  ╔═ Reject a proposal ══════════════════════════════╗  
  ║ ⚠ Reject proposal p-0005?                        ║  
  ║                                                  ║  
  ║ The proposal is closed as rejected and nothing   ║  
  ║ on the host changes. The reason, if you give     ║  
  ║ one, is shown to the submitter.                  ║  
  ║ $ sudo qhost proposal reject p-0005 --reason     ║  
  ║   'not this host' --output json                  ║  
  ║                                                  ║  
  ║ [ yes, with sudo ]  [ enter cancel ]             ║  
  ║ y yes, with sudo  n/esc/enter cancel             ║  
  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════╝  
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
                                                        
